s/work-backlog-item/SKILL.md plugins/development-harness/skills/groom-backlog-item/SKILL.md plugins/development-harness/skills/work-backlog-item/references/sam-definition.md`\\n\\n### Questions for Human\\n\\n- Is `.claude/agents/backlog-item-groomer.md` the canonical post-lift location for the groomer agent, or was it supposed to move to `plugins/development-harness/agents/backlog-item-groomer.md`? The domain-registry currently points to the `.claude/agents/` path, which exists, but no copy is in the plugin agents directory. This affects whether the Agents table entry in domain-registry.md needs updating.\\n\\n### Resources\\n\\n| Type | Item |\\n|------|------|\\n| File | `.claude/skills/backlog-tools-administrator/references/domain-registry.md` |\\n| File | `.claude/skills/evaluate-sdlc-layers/SKILL.md` |\\n| File | `.claude/skills/start-milestone/SKILL.md` (no changes needed) |\\n| Prior work | `plugins/development-harness/skills/backlog/SKILL.md` |\\n| Prior work | `plugins/development-harness/skills/work-backlog-item/references/sam-definition.md` |\\n\\n### Dependencies\\n\\n- Depends on: P778 backlog lift (already done \u2014 skills confirmed at new paths)\\n- Blocks: None\\n\\n### Effort\\n\\nSmall \u2014 mechanical text substitution in two files (domain-registry.md has ~12 path replacements; evaluate-sdlc-layers/SKILL.md has 1). No logic changes, no new files.\\n\\n### File 1: `.claude/skills/backlog-tools-administrator/references/domain-registry.md`\\n\\n**Skills table (lines 30\u201333) \u2014 all four paths do not exist on disk:**\\n\\n| Stale | Replacement |\\n|-------|-------------|\\n| `.claude/skills/backlog/SKILL.md` | `plugins/development-harness/skills/backlog/SKILL.md` |\\n| `.claude/skills/create-backlog-item/SKILL.md` | `plugins/development-harness/skills/create-backlog-item/SKILL.md` |\\n| `.claude/skills/work-backlog-item/SKILL.md` | `plugins/development-harness/skills/work-backlog-item/SKILL.md` |\\n| `.claude/skills/groom-backlog-item/SKILL.md` | `plugins/development-harness/skills/groom-backlog-item/SKILL.md` |\\n\\n**Primary Script (line 24) \u2014 path does not exist on disk:**\\n\\n| Stale | Status |\\n|-------|--------|\\n| `.claude/skills/backlog/scripts/backlog.py` | Dead \u2014 script moved to MCP server at `plugins/development-harness/backlog_core/server.py`. Description needs updating to reflect MCP interface instead of Typer CLI. |\\n\\n**Agents table (line 39) \u2014 path does not exist on disk:**\\n\\n| Stale | Status |\\n|-------|--------|\\n| `.claude/agents/backlog-item-groomer.md` | File exists at `.claude/agents/backlog-item-groomer.md` (local copy) but NOT at `plugins/development-harness/agents/backlog-item-groomer.md`. Domain registry should reference whichever location is canonical post-lift. Requires human clarification (see Questions). |\\n\\n**Skill References section (lines 44\u201358) \u2014 all sub-paths dead:**\\n\\n| Stale prefix | Replacement prefix |\\n|---|---|\\n| `.claude/skills/backlog/references/` | `plugins/development-harness/skills/backlog/references/` |\\n| `.claude/skills/work-backlog-item/references/` | `plugins/development-harness/skills/work-backlog-item/references/` |\\n\\nAll six reference files confirmed present at new paths:\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/backlog/references/item-schema.md` \u2713\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/backlog/references/known-patterns.md` \u2713\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/backlog/references/state-machine.md` \u2713\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/work-backlog-item/references/` (auto-mode, close-resolve-procedure, error-handling, example-sessions, github-integration, sam-definition, step-procedures, validation-plan) \u2014 paths in registry match post-lift prefix.\\n\\n**Skill Templates (line 62\u201363) \u2014 paths dead:**\\n\\n| Stale | Replacement |\\n|-------|-------------|\\n| `.claude/skills/backlog/templates/item.md` | `plugins/development-harness/skills/backlog/templates/item.md` |\